                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gorilless",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf581a99-f2a5-388d-ada2-daf86f36b4eb",
                                        "entry_id": "cc7049b2-5d83-3d1f-9441-19f127db0676",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A female gorilla."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "no-plural",
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f17c13e-a616-4331-bb2d-fdd208173afa",
                                                "sense_id": "cf581a99-f2a5-388d-ada2-daf86f36b4eb",
                                                "text": "The last statement suggests to me the question, did she walk upon her hind legs only, or upon all four? That is, did she walk erect like a man and a brother,—I should say a gorilless and a sister,—or like an attached and humble individual of the canine or feline quadruped species?[…]Was not Seraphine a wonderful young person,—I mean gorilless?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "36bd363d-4293-4cd2-8e9b-bd26ee960348",
                                                "sense_id": "cf581a99-f2a5-388d-ada2-daf86f36b4eb",
                                                "text": "“An’ now I hear you’re sendin’ our flagship Pastores out at four o’clock this afternoon with another cock-eyed cross between a giraffe an’ a Gila monster— / “By my soul, never!” yells th’ G.P.A., jumpin’ up like a bumb has gone off under him. “If the Pastores sails with that red-skirted gorilless aboard, it’ll be over my dead body!”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "807ed0bd-2bf2-4abd-a945-e22009ea3635",
                                                "sense_id": "cf581a99-f2a5-388d-ada2-daf86f36b4eb",
                                                "text": "I know it’s horribly sexist but, it has to be said, so are gorillas. / Then there’s the lonely gorilless whose mate has died just before breeding time, leaving both her and her devoted keeper desolate with grief."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81e4295b-6d49-4254-9fa0-68c1920cb737",
                                                "sense_id": "cf581a99-f2a5-388d-ada2-daf86f36b4eb",
                                                "text": "On another day, at the Program Corporation of America, a White Plains-based company that serves as lecture managers and booking agencies for celebrities, the gorilla was invited to stay for lunch. “You’re a “gorilless,” Joan Steinhaus, executive vice president, said as Miss Corsetti removed the head of her costume. “Would you like a banana?”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "334129cf-457e-4252-946f-df99a701728f",
                                                "sense_id": "cf581a99-f2a5-388d-ada2-daf86f36b4eb",
                                                "text": "She wanted a job with Phyllis the Gorilless."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
